kerf 1
tempo 127
key G minor
tags four-four acid

module tally1 Tally tempo=0.5 swing=0.08 divide=0.5
module mix    Router level1=0.85 level2=0.65 level3=0.4 level4=0.55 level5=0.5 level6=0.85 send=0.25
module room   Kiln   size=0.5 heat=0.55 bloom=0.25 mix=1
